{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__review-gate#feature-1","repo":"JohnXu22786/review-gate","commit":"e979d7512c896c1c0e265882dc847c39bac95765","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-gate 的功能「审查差异」：根据工作区、暂存区、单个提交或提交范围运行审查，组合确定性规则与可选 LLM 发现，并产出分级结果和门禁状态。 通过 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/tools.ts:26-60"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__review-gate#feature-2","repo":"JohnXu22786/review-gate","commit":"e979d7512c896c1c0e265882dc847c39bac95765","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-gate 的功能「确定性门禁」：按未确认发现的严重级别阈值和必需确认项计算自动门禁；审批无法覆盖未通过的自动门禁。 通过 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/gate/engine.ts:20-53"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__review-gate#feature-3","repo":"JohnXu22786/review-gate","commit":"e979d7512c896c1c0e265882dc847c39bac95765","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-gate 的功能「团队审批」：团队成员可批准、请求修改或拒绝；每位审阅者在当前轮的最新投票生效，达到配置的审批人数才解锁合并。 通过 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/approval/flow.ts:20-57"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__review-gate#feature-4","repo":"JohnXu22786/review-gate","commit":"e979d7512c896c1c0e265882dc847c39bac95765","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"review-gate 的功能「审计报告」：将会话状态、发现、确认、投票和审计事件整理为 JSON 或 Markdown 报告，供审阅和归档。 通过 DSH 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/audit/report.ts:22-50"]}
